// Part of the LLVM Project (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception).
//  ccwrap llibcxx03: <variant> for Open Watcom. Open Watcom has no variadic
//  templates, so this is a FIXED-ARITY variant of up to 4 alternatives
//  (variant<T0[,T1[,T2[,T3]]]>). Unused slots default to a private __nil type.
//  Storage is an aligned buffer (a C++03 union cannot hold non-trivial types);
//  construct/copy/destroy dispatch on the runtime index via a switch. Provides
//  index(), holds_alternative<T>, get<T>/get_if<T> (by type), and single-visitor
//  visit(). get<I> by index and multi-type visitors are omitted (need the
//  metaprogramming Open Watcom can't express).
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//
